; expect-error: E_INTEGER_OVERFLOW
; The negative side has one more value than the positive: -9223372036854775808
; fits, and one past it does not. That used to wrap to 9223372036854775807,
; which is worse than reading 0 -- the program carried on with a plausible
; number of the wrong sign.
(use core/core)
(defn main ()
  (print -9223372036854775809))
(numeric checked)
